### API Gateway JWT Authentication & Role Authorization Playground
### Gateway runs on http://localhost:8080 (Single Entry Point)

@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ==========================================================================
### 1. DEMO AUTHENTICATION (Minting Tokens in non-prod profiles)
### ==========================================================================

### 1.1 Login as Root (ROLE_ADMIN + ROLE_USER)
# @name rootLogin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "root",
  "password": "<ROOT_PASSWORD from .env>"
}

### Capture root access token
@rootToken = {{rootLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1.2 Login as Demo User (ROLE_USER only)
# @name userLogin
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "demo-user",
  "password": "<DEMO_USER_PASSWORD from .env>"
}

### Capture user access token
@userToken = {{userLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 1.3 Failed Login - Wrong Password (Expects 401 ProblemDetail)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "root",
  "password": "incorrect-password"
}

### ==========================================================================
### 2. ROLE-BASED ACCESS CONTROL (RBAC) VERIFICATION
### ==========================================================================

### 2.1 Read Operation with ROLE_USER Token (Expects 200 OK)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 Mutating Operation with ROLE_USER Token (Expects 403 Forbidden ProblemDetail)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sku": "FORBIDDEN-MOUSE-01",
  "name": "Unauthorized Creation Item",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "unitId": 1
}

### 2.3 Mutating Operation with ROLE_ADMIN Token (Expects 201 Created)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{rootToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "sku": "AUTHORIZED-KEYBOARD-01",
  "name": "Admin Authorized Creation Item",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "unitId": 1
}

### 2.4 Warehouse Mutating Operation with ROLE_ADMIN Token (Expects 201 Created)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer {{rootToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "WH-SOUTH-01",
  "name": "South Distribution Hub"
}

### ==========================================================================
### 3. SECURITY SAFEGUARDS & FAILURE PATHS
### ==========================================================================

### 3.1 Missing Authorization Header (Expects 401 Unauthorized ProblemDetail)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Forged/Tampered Token (Expects 401 Unauthorized ProblemDetail)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJoYWNrZXIifQ.fake-signature
Accept: application/json

### 3.3 Expired Token (Expects 401 Unauthorized ProblemDetail)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJvbGQtdXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTYwMDAwMDAwMCwiZXhwIjoxNjAwMDAwMTAwfQ.fake
Accept: application/json

### 3.4 Anti-Spoofing Check: Gateway ignores client-supplied X-User-Id header
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
X-User-Id: attacker-trying-to-impersonate-root
Accept: application/json
